OL,3,A'Good for the people' if politicians
OL,4,Astopped doing media, says secretary of
OL,5,Astate
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe secretary of state for Northern
OL,8,FIreland has said that if politicians
OL,9,Fstayed off the media for a month it
OL,10,Fwould "probably be very good for the
OL,11,Fpeople".
OL,13,FSir Chris Bryant said it breaks his
OL,14,Fheart that because of the crisis over
OL,15,Fagreeing a budget he can't get round to
OL,16,Fissues like violence against women and
OL,17,Fgirls, or resolving community tensions.
OL,19,FHe told a committee of MPs that was
OL,20,F"one of the symbols of the kind of
OL,21,Fcomplete abnormality that now seems to
OL,22,Fpervade Northern Ireland politics".
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
